# Crouched (K held) through a powerslide at speed, a hand goes down: a Bert Slide (300 + 200 per
# second). Letting go of both at once pops an ollie out of it, so the slide carries the combo into
# the air and banks on the landing.
park lab
cmd 0 teleport -20 -12 0.13 90
cmd 9 speed 9
hold ollie 10..80
hold slide 12..80
run 300
expect event trickEnd{trick=FS Bert Slide} within 79..82
expect event pop within 79..82
expect event comboLanded{name=FS Bert Slide} within 150..260
expect no event bail
